WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.000
Open Pose from your image and choose a full-body photo or drawing.

00:03.000 --> 00:06.000
Select an image to fit its pose to the 3D mannequin.

00:06.000 --> 00:09.000
The source photo appears beside the mannequin fitted to its pose.

00:09.000 --> 00:11.500
Orbit the mannequin to inspect the pose from another angle.

00:11.500 --> 00:14.400
Switch mannequin views, then download the rig or its depth map.
